BIG.outline[17] | 6, 190, 16, 16 | The notch at a corner of the outline style, used where a marked area turns an inside corner. As painted it's for the north-east corner; the game turns it for the others and combines them. The borders of each faction's territory on the world map draw it.
BIG.dashed[17] | 28, 190, 16, 16 | The corner notch of the dashed style. As painted it's for the north-east corner. Unverified: no code was found that draws the corners of this style.
BIG.dashedThick[17] | 50, 190, 16, 16 | The corner notch of the dashedThick style. As painted it's for the north-east corner. Unverified: no code was found that draws the corners of this style.
BIG.solid[17] | 72, 190, 16, 16 | The corner notch of the solid style. As painted it's for the north-east corner. Unverified: no code was found that draws the corners of this style.
BIG.dots[17] | 94, 190, 16, 16 | The corner notch of the dots style. As painted it's for the north-east corner. Unverified: no code was found that draws the corners of this style.
BIG.line[17] | 116, 190, 16, 16 | The corner notch of the line style. As painted it's for the north-east corner. Unverified: no code was found that draws the corners of this style.
BIG.dashed_hollow[17] | 160, 190, 16, 16 | The notch at a corner of the dashed_hollow style, used where a marked area turns an inside corner. As painted it's for the north-east corner; the game turns it for the others and combines them. The borders of each faction's territory on the world map draw it.
BIG.filled[17] | 204, 190, 16, 16 | The corner notch of the filled style. As painted it's for the north-east corner. Unverified: no code was found that draws the corners of this style.
BIG.filled_striped[17] | 248, 190, 16, 16 | The corner notch of the filled_striped style. As painted it's for the north-east corner. Unverified: no code was found that draws the corners of this style.
ICO.unclear | 6, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn by the code for clearing jobs and for filling in caves.
ICO.clear | 28, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn by the code for clearing jobs, the tile and landing placers, and the world map's pathing code.
ICO.cancel | 50, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn by the placer for choosing where to land.
ICO.arrows | 72, 218, 16, 16 | A direction arrow, as painted and turned three times. Room placers draw it to show which way a piece faces, for example on pumps, the throne and supply rooms.
ICO.arrows2[0] | 94, 218, 16, 16 | One of two direction arrows, each as painted and turned three times, alternating to make 8. Used on the world map for routes and region links, and in battle for the facing of divisions.
ICO.arrows2[1] | 116, 218, 16, 16 | One of two direction arrows, each as painted and turned three times, alternating to make 8. Used on the world map for routes and region links, and in battle for the facing of divisions.
ICO.crosshair | 138, 218, 16, 16 | A target marker, drawn for example over animals marked for hunting and by clearing jobs.
ICO.smallup | 160, 218, 16, 16 | Loaded, but never drawn.
ICO.repair | 182, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn by the repair placer and on rooms that need repair.
ICO.arrows_inward | 204, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn by the room and furniture placers.
ICO.warning | 226, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn over a job that can't go ahead for now: the resource it needs can't be reached, or for a harvest, the crops aren't ripe.
ICO.tile | 248, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn only by the pathfinder's test code.
ICO.scratch | 270, 218, 16, 16 | Drawn by the code for clearing jobs and for the settlement's entry points.
ICO.arrows_inwards | 292, 218, 16, 16 | Arrows pointing inwards, as painted and turned three times. Drawn by the room and furniture placers.
ICO.arrows_entity | 314, 218, 16, 16 | The arrow drawn over people and animals in some settlement overlays, pointing the way each one is moving. It's turned to 4 directions, and each turn is used for two of the 8 directions.
ROT.single | 6, 246, 16, 16 | Loaded, but never drawn. It's loaded in four turns.
ROT.join | 28, 246, 16, 16 | Loaded, but never drawn. It's loaded in four turns.
ROT.join_thin | 50, 246, 16, 16 | Loaded, but never drawn. It's loaded in four turns.
ROT.north_south | 72, 246, 16, 16 | Loaded, but never drawn. It's loaded in four turns.
ROT.full | 94, 246, 16, 16 | The marker drawn on each tile of a gatehouse while it's being placed and until that tile is built, turned to show which way the tile faces.
ROT.join_big | 116, 246, 16, 16 | Loaded, but never drawn. It's loaded in four turns.
fullArrows[0] | 6, 274, 16, 16 | The arrow drawn on some pieces of an execution ground and a guard post while they're placed and until they're built, turned to show which way the piece faces. The game turns it for the other three directions.
